type: flowchart
title: User Signup Flow

- Start [start]
  → Enter Details
- Enter Details
  → Validate Form [decision]
- Validate Form [decision]
  → Check Email: valid
  → Show Errors: invalid
- Show Errors
  → Enter Details
- Check Email [decision]
  → Send Verification: available
  → Show Errors: taken
- Send Verification
  → Verify Email
- Verify Email
  → Activate Account
- Activate Account
  → End [end]
